---@param embattleView EmbattleNewView
function TrainEmbattleView:SetInfo()
    ---隐藏 Top
    -- self.embattleView.go_table.obj_power1:GetParent():SetActiveE(0)

    self:SetTips(self.train_section_cfgItem)
